        "original_id": "df084426-56a1-5176-9cab-5bc068cf2c4d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hermann Oberth\n- Concepts: Oberth effect\n- Topics: Modern rocketry\n\nFacts:\n- Hermann Julius Oberth was born on 25 June 1894 and died on 28 December 1989.\n- Hermann Oberth was an Austro-Hungarian-born German physicist and engineer.\n- Hermann Oberth was a founder of modern rocketry.\n- Hermann Oberth first described the maneuver and effect later called the Oberth effect in 1927.\n- The Oberth effect and its maneuver are named after Hermann Oberth.",
